## Products in Depth

### Elementor (Core)
https://elementor.com/
The free, open-source WordPress plugin at the heart of the platform. It replaces the default WordPress editor with a live, drag-and-drop visual canvas: you build pages by dragging widgets (headings, images, buttons, galleries, etc.) onto a section/column or flexbox/grid container layout and styling them visually. Includes responsive editing (desktop/tablet/mobile breakpoints), 100+ widgets, basic templates, and full design control without writing code.

### Elementor Pro
https://elementor.com/pro/
The premium upgrade installed on top of core. Unlocks the **Theme Builder** (design headers, footers, single-post, archive, and 404 templates visually), **WooCommerce Builder** (custom product and shop pages), **Popup Builder**, **Form Builder** (with marketing/CRM integrations), **dynamic content** (bind designs to WordPress fields and custom fields), motion effects, custom CSS, the full template/kit library, and 90+ additional Pro widgets. Sold as an annual subscription tiered by the number of sites.

### Website Builder
https://elementor.com/products/website-builder/
An all-in-one managed offering that bundles the Elementor editor with cloud hosting and a connected domain, so a user can build and publish a live WordPress site without separately sourcing hosting. Aimed at people who want a single product rather than assembling plugin + host + domain themselves.

### Elementor One
https://elementor.com/one/
A subscription bundle that unifies the tools needed to run a WordPress site over time — hosting, security, backups, monitoring, AI, and site management — into one plan. Positioned for creators who want ongoing operations and maintenance handled in one place.

### Elementor Hosting
https://elementor.com/hosting/
Managed WordPress cloud hosting built specifically for Elementor sites, running on Google Cloud Platform with a Cloudflare Enterprise CDN, automatic SSL, daily backups, and staging. WordPress and Elementor Pro come pre-installed and managed, removing the need for separate hosting configuration.

### Elementor AI
https://elementor.com/ai-page-builder/
Build by prompting. Full pages, design systems, forms, and loops, generated as real, structured Elementor content. Everything stays fully editable, yours to shape.

### Angie — AI for WordPress
https://elementor.com/products/angie-ai-for-wordpress/
A conversational AI agent for WordPress that helps users build, manage, and troubleshoot their site through natural-language chat — acting as an in-context assistant for site operations.

### Image Optimizer
https://elementor.com/products/image-optimizer/
A WordPress plugin that automatically compresses, resizes, and converts images to next-gen formats (WebP/AVIF), reducing page weight and improving Core Web Vitals and load speed without manual image processing.

### Site Mailer
https://elementor.com/products/site-mailer/
A transactional email-delivery and SMTP service that improves WordPress email deliverability (form notifications, WooCommerce receipts, password resets) so site emails reach the inbox without configuring a third-party SMTP provider.

### Ally — Web Accessibility
https://elementor.com/products/ally-web-accessibility/
An accessibility plugin that helps WordPress sites move toward compliance with WCAG, the ADA, and the European Accessibility Act (EAA) — providing accessibility tooling and remediation features.

### Cookie Consent
https://elementor.com/products/cookie-consent/
A consent-management tool and cookie banner for GDPR/CCPA compliance, letting site owners collect and manage visitor cookie consent.

### Speed & Performance
https://elementor.com/speed-performance/
Elementor's performance layer: optimized CSS/JS loading, reduced DOM output, lazy loading, and improvements targeting Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for faster, better-ranking pages.

### Domains
https://elementor.com/domains/
Register and manage custom domains directly through Elementor, connected to Elementor-hosted sites.

### Manage
https://elementor.com/products/manage/
A central dashboard for managing all of a user's Elementor websites, subscriptions, and licenses from one place.

### Themes & Specialized Builders
- **Hello Theme** — https://elementor.com/hello-theme/ — Elementor's lightweight, near-blank "canvas" theme, built for speed and to hand full layout control to the builder.
- **Ecommerce Builder** — https://elementor.com/ecommerce-builder/ — WooCommerce-powered store building with design control over product, cart, and checkout pages.

